    <TD STYLE="padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">written notice as further provided in these Articles unless otherwise specifically stated;</FONT></TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
