    <TD STYLE="padding: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">the person appointed to perform any or all of the duties of secretary of the Company and includes any deputy or assistant secretary and any person appointed by the Board to perform any of the duties of the Secretary;</FONT></TD></TR>
</TABLE>

